{"id":"42cfcb11f4e2b586","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Computable Measure","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real.md]]","[[58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[58-df-effective-rational-coding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-measure — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a11ffd0523da6a6c\" href=\"?note=a11ffd0523da6a6c\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-real.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"58-df-sigma-generated.md\">58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b8eaf43a040e88b2\" href=\"?note=b8eaf43a040e88b2\" title=\"58-df-effective-rational-coding.md\">58-df-effective-rational-coding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\mu\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n\\in\\omega\">\\(e,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\)</span> 由内部程序编号文件定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_k\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rat}(k)\">\\(q_k\\coloneqq\\operatorname{rat}(k)\\)</span> 由内部有理数编号文件定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{2^\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma_{2^\\omega}\\)</span> 使用原依赖中的谓词与生成运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMeasure}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMeasure}_S(\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\!\\left(\n2^\\omega,\n\\sigma_{2^\\omega}\\bigl(\\{\\{x\\in2^\\omega:x\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\}:s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr),\n\\mu\\right)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi_e(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s),n))\\downarrow\n\\land\\left|\nq_{\\varphi_e(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s),n))}\n-\\mu(\\{x\\in2^\\omega:x\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\})\n\\right|\\leq2^{-n}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMeasure}_S(\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\!\\left(\n2^\\omega,\n\\sigma_{2^\\omega}\\bigl(\\{\\{x\\in2^\\omega:x\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\}:s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\bigr),\n\\mu\\right)\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi_e(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s),n))\\downarrow\n\\land\\left|\nq_{\\varphi_e(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s),n))}\n-\\mu(\\{x\\in2^\\omega:x\\upharpoonright\\operatorname{dom}(s)=s\\})\n\\right|\\leq2^{-n}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A single program uniformly approximates the measures of all basic cylinders.</li>\n<li>Pointwise computability of each cylinder value, with an index depending non-effectively on the cylinder, is insufficient.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","